    "title": "Daily Weather",
    "description": "Discover weather changes anytime, anywhere.Weather information at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nSee realistic rain, snow or thunderstorm weather animations, sun rays for clear days, the moon\u2019s glow and the stars at night, shooting stars, moving clouds and many more weather animations.\r\n\r\nPrepare for your day with accurate current conditions, chance of precipitation, hourly and daily forecasts.\r\n\r\nReal weather information\r\n-Display the real-time temperature and weather type.\r\n\r\nHourly  forecast information\r\n-Master the daily dynamics, calmly prepare for travel.\r\n\r\nExtreme weather alert\r\n-Severe and extreme weather warnings to help you prepare for weather changes.\r\n\r\nWeather details\r\n-You can get not only temperature and clock information, but also humidity, visibility, UV index, air pressure, wind speed, sunrise and sunset.\r\n\r\nGlobal weather\r\n\r\n-This accurate weather app allows you to add global cities to the list and get real-time local weather forecast information. No matter where you are, you can bring this weather app!\r\n\r\nNice widgets\r\n-The application contains various exquisite widget styles, you can choose your favorite style and appearance to beautify your desktop.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover weather changes anytime, anywhere.Weather information at your fingertips.<br><br>See realistic rain, snow or thunderstorm weather animations, sun rays for clear days, the moon\u2019s glow and the stars at night, shooting stars, moving clouds and many more weather animations.<br><br>Prepare for your day with accurate current conditions, chance of precipitation, hourly and daily forecasts.<br><br>Real weather information<br>-Display the real-time temperature and weather type.<br><br>Hourly  forecast information<br>-Master the daily dynamics, calmly prepare for travel.<br><br>Extreme weather alert<br>-Severe and extreme weather warnings to help you prepare for weather changes.<br><br>Weather details<br>-You can get not only temperature and clock information, but also humidity, visibility, UV index, air pressure, wind speed, sunrise and sunset.<br><br>Global weather<br><br>-This accurate weather app allows you to add global cities to the list and get real-time local weather forecast information. No matter where you are, you can bring this weather app!<br><br>Nice widgets<br>-The application contains various exquisite widget styles, you can choose your favorite style and appearance to beautify your desktop.",
